---
description: BedeBestan monorepo — read AGENTS.md first; features live under features/
alwaysApply: true
---

Before coding, read `AGENTS.md` then only the one doc `docs/AGENTS.md` maps for the task. Do not load the whole `docs/` tree.

Non-negotiables:
- Feature packages under `features/` (never `apps/bedeh_bestan/lib/src/features/`)
- Pages → Controller → Repository → local source; widgets have no `ref`
- No cross-feature imports; shared code in `core` / `ui_kit`
- Paths only in `AppRoutes`; slang for all UI strings (`melos run translations`)
- Local-only: no backend, auth, sync, or `api_client`
- Finish with `melos run analyze && melos run test`
